{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/617455-requiem-for-rome-and-setting-suggestions","id":617455,"title":"Requiem for Rome and setting suggestions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-06T03:19:38-07:00","id":617455,"title":"Requiem for Rome and setting suggestions","content":"I'm tring to build up a story in requiem for rome. But I have huge problems with the settings and life at that times.<br /> First of all...I think there was wall sourronding all the city but some paesant villages were left out right? How can a foreigner, probably poor and dirty for the travel can approach inside the city? Without using disciplines I means. I just want to understand the customs at that time. Were there soldier at any entrance in the walls? Did they let get inside everyone? Still during night?? Or did the ask for information and let outside evidently poor people? Can you give me some general advice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T10:58:18-07:00","id":617880,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for a good, easy to read primer on life in ancient Rome, this book is excellent:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/Travellers-Guide-Ancient-World-Rome/dp/0715329200\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_pl